===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}
#Of a situation etc.: Extremely [[sensitive]] or [[volatile]]; easily [[disturbed]] to the point of becoming [[unstable]]; requiring [[caution]] or [[tactfulness]].
#:''It is an extremely '''touchy''' situation, with everybody's patience wearing thin.''
#Of a person: Easily [[angered]].
#:''He can be very '''touchy''' after such a long day, so be gentle.''

